     \cf22 \cb23  20 +\cf9 One command. Zero decisions. From a fresh checkout to a running UI in ~30 seconds:                                                                                                                                         \cf2 \cb1 \
     \cf22 \cb23  21 +\cf9                                                                                                                                                                                                                            \cf2 \cb1 \
     \cf12  22\cf2  \cf9  ```bash\cf2 \
     \cf12  23\cf2  \cf9  git\cf2  \cf9 clone\cf2  \cf9 <repo>\cf2  \cf9 volscope\cf2  \cf9 &&\cf2  \cf9 cd\cf2  \cf9 volscope\cf2 \
     \cf20 \cb21  22 -\cf9 make setup                                                                                                                                                                                                                 \cf2 \cb1 \
