     \cf20 \cb21   55 -\cf9 Edit `volscope/data/ticker_universe.py` and add to the appropriate sector bucket.                                                                                                                                         \cf2 \cb1 \
     \cf22 \cb23  118 +\cf9 Three ways, in order of convenience:                                                                                                                                                                                      \cf2 \cb1 \
     \cf12  119\cf2  \cf9  \cf2 \
     \cf20 \cb21   57 -\cf9 ## Daily Scraping                                                                                                                                                                                                         \cf2 \cb1 \
     \cf22 \cb23  120 +\cf9 1. **Sidebar "Add ticker" box** \'97 works at runtime, no restart.                                                                                                                                                           \cf2 \cb1 \
     \cf22 \cb23  121 +\cf9 2. **Sidebar "Live screener \'97 bulk load"** \'97 loads the full curated universe.                                                                                                                                             \cf2 \cb1 \
